      "parameters": {
        "content": "# AI Agent\n\nAn advanced node for building AI agents capable of reasoning, decision-making, and utilizing tools (e.g., HTTP, Code) with memory support.\n\nUnlike a Basic LLM Chain, an agent operates with a reasoning loop, allowing it to call multiple tools iteratively to solve complex tasks like research or dynamic automation.",
